e results of operations also depend largely on our ability to execute our future plans successfully. In particular, our continued growth may subject us to the following additional challenges and constraints:","block":221,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-011249","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-18","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002030954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030954/000149315226011249/form10-k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b.bin","sha256":"05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b"}},{"id":"6e9f1670bfc424edd0e3baf047bf9f54a3e9294b1e03839d62c8b44691a9832b","quote":"●the execution of our future plans will be subject to the availability of funds to support the relevant capital investment and expenditures; and","context":"●the technological or operational challenges may arise from the new services;","section":"Our future results of operations also depend largely on our ability to execute our future plans successfully. In particular, our continued growth may subject us to the following additional challenges and constraints:","block":222,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-011249","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-18","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002030954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030954/000149315226011249/form10-k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b.bin","sha256":"05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b"}},{"id":"47c9e6ded7319280e93bca0df7424a5011b48c4ab60403fb5b3f6802abd44e24","quote":"●the successful execution of our strategies is subject to factors beyond our control, such as general market conditions, and economic and political developments in the United States and globally.","context":"●the execution of our future plans will be subject to the availability of funds to support the relevant capital investment and expenditures; and","section":"Our future results of operations also depend largely on our ability to execute our future plans successfully. In particular, our continued growth may subject us to the following additional challenges and constraints:","block":223,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-011249","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-18","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002030954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030954/000149315226011249/form10-k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b.bin","sha256":"05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b"}},{"id":"0df9c7614e06534b13f4135d93e2dfc30f9c1be07e4027c85b83bbd912437722","quote":"All of these endeavors involve risks and will require significant management, financial, and human resources. We cannot assure you that we will be able to effectively manage our growth or to implement our strategies successfully. There is no assurance that the investment to be made by our Company as contemplated under our future plans will be successful and generate the expected return. If we are not able to manage our growth or execute our strategies effectively, or at all, our business, results of operations, and prospects may be materially and adversely affected.","context":"●the successful execution of our strategies is subject to factors beyond our control, such as general market conditions, and economic and political developments in the United States and globally.","section":"Our future results of operations also depend largely on our ability to execute our future plans successfully. In particular, our continued growth may subject us to the following additional challenges and constraints:","block":224,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-011249","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-18","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002030954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030954/000149315226011249/form10-k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b.bin","sha256":"05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b"}},{"id":"5dde93384fd330d930fdd913e267c2334069206d1a01e8c1c9d31245cc452142","quote":"If we fail to attract, recruit, or retain our key personnel, including our executive officers, senior management, and key employees, our ongoing operations and growth could be affected.","context":"All of these endeavors involve risks and will require significant management, financial, and human resources. We cannot assure you that we will be able to effectively manage our growth or to implement our strategies successfully. There is no assurance that the investment to be made by our Company as contemplated under our future plans will be successful and generate the expected return. If we are not able to manage our growth or execute our strategies effectively, or at all, our business, results of operations, and prospects may be materially and adversely affected.","section":"Our future results of operations also depend largely on our ability to execute our future plans successfully. In particular, our continued growth may subject us to the following additional challenges and constraints:","block":225,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-011249","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-18","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002030954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030954/000149315226011249/form10-k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b.bin","sha256":"05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b"}},{"id":"582b506c63b3223243b324ca17f4ec589049c0d3b126a95c730323d01e4c09e9","quote":"Our success depends, to a large extent, on the efforts of our key personnel, including our executive officers, senior management, and other key employees who have valuable experience, knowledge, and connections in the webcasting industry. There is no assurance that these key personnel will not voluntarily terminate their employment with us. We do not carry any key person insurance on any of our senior management team. The loss of any of our key personnel could be detrimental to our ongoing operations. Our success will also depend on our ability to attract and retain qualified personnel to manage our existing operations as well as our future growth. We may not be able to successfully attract, recruit, or retain key personnel, and this could adversely impact our financial condition, operating results, and business prospects.","context":"If we fail to attract, recruit, or retain our key personnel, including our executive officers, senior management, and key employees, our ongoing operations and growth could be affected.","section":"Our future results of operations also depend largely on our ability to execute our future plans successfully. In particular, our continued growth may subject us to the following additional challenges and constraints:","block":226,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-011249","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-18","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002030954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030954/000149315226011249/form10-k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b.bin","sha256":"05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b"}},{"id":"ae5aa6ff9874623603618c2f76fbb18496925be3f8593de303272678959e1850","quote":"In addition, we depend on the expertise and efforts of members of our operations and technology teams for the continued performance of our platform. Our ability to retain, attract, hire and train staff in these groups may prove to be a challenge for a variety of factors and could have an adverse impact on the platform.","context":"Our success depends, to a large extent, on the efforts of our key personnel, including our executive officers, senior management, and other key employees who have valuable experience, knowledge, and connections in the webcasting industry. There is no assurance that these key personnel will not voluntarily terminate their employment with us. We do not carry any key person insurance on any of our senior management team. The loss of any of our key personnel could be detrimental to our ongoing operations. Our success will also depend on our ability to attract and retain qualified personnel to manage our existing operations as well as our future growth. We may not be able to successfully attract, recruit, or retain key personnel, and this could adversely impact our financial condition, operating results, and business prospects.","section":"Our future results of operations also depend largely on our ability to execute our future plans successfully. In particular, our continued growth may subject us to the following additional challenges and constraints:","block":227,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-011249","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-18","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002030954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030954/000149315226011249/form10-k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b.bin","sha256":"05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b"}},{"id":"ef5b957228bd87c9280172eb54811b3f824e1361f80db0e4b21b40d2cca66dbd","quote":"We may not maintain adequate insurance, which could expose us to significant costs and business disruption.","context":"In addition, we depend on the expertise and efforts of members of our operations and technology teams for the continued performance of our platform. Our ability to retain, attract, hire and train staff in these groups may prove to be a challenge for a variety of factors and could have an adverse impact on the platform.","section":"Our future results of operations also depend largely on our ability to execute our future plans successfully. In particular, our continued growth may subject us to the following additional challenges and constraints:","block":228,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-011249","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-18","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0002030954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2030954/000149315226011249/form10-k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b.bin","sha256":"05abaf31f827a375d58018aa72a4261f32e9ec1f43012cb1352f7f690039f16b"}},{"id":"b9af83e7702784f3b802b93ba1ff046d07c269b2d6618b295361594cdaaf71b8","quote":"We maintain certain insurance policies to safeguard against risks and unexpected events. See “Item 1. Business – Insurance.” However, there can be no assurance that such insurance coverage will always be available or will always be sufficient to cover any damages resulting from any kind of claims. In addition, there are certain types of risks that may not be covered by our insurance policies, such as war, force majeure events, or certain business interruptions. Claims that are not covered by the policies or the failure to renew the insurance policies may materially adversely affect our business, financial condition, and results of operations.","context":"We may not maintain adequate insurance, which could expose us to significant costs and business disruption.","section":"